Wow!  So the @DNC PAID someone to come out and try to sway voters … on stage.  Isn’t that illegal?

@realDonaldTrump you ever pay anyone to come speak at your rallies?  

@vp @KamalaHarris @KamalaHQ @BarackObama I guess when Kamalala said she’d follow the laws, she didn’t know what that meant?  I know her resume but she’s out of her league and it shows in everything she and her “staff” do.

